81:     Rule:
82:     - For each color, order its pixels by polar angle around their centroid to form a cycle.
83:     - Draw only horizontal, vertical, or 45-degree edges whose interiors are clear.
84:     - From the chosen start vertex, copy adjacent shadow offsets along each drawable edge
